<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Se solicita la Autorizacion de los Gastos Extras en este Embarque, favor de confirmar Recepción de esta Solicitud y continuar con el proceso.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Shipment:&nbsp;</span><font face="arial"><b>{!Shipment__c.Name}</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">Shipment Sell Price (Venta):&nbsp;{!Shipment__c.Total_Services_Sell_Amount__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">Shipment Buy Price (Costo):&nbsp;{!Shipment__c.Total_Services_Std_Buy_Amount__c}</font></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div></div>]]></td>
